  "content": {
    "code": "# for loop의 동작 원리: Iterator Protocol\nclass Counter:\n    def __init__(self, start, end):\n        self.current = start\n        self.end = end\n\n    def __iter__(self):\n        return self\n\n    def __next__(self):\n        if self.current >= self.end:\n            raise StopIteration\n        value = self.current\n        self.current += 1\n        return value\n\ncounter = Counter(0, 3)\n\nfor num in counter:\n    print(num)",
